This license covers CROSSHOST's own code and the derived activity-value
tables in data/core/ (attribution to Johns et al. 2018 required — see
data/core/CITATION.md). It does NOT cover:
  - data/licensed/deepcross/ (DeepCROSS-derived data, MIT academic-only,
    commercial use requires contacting the DeepCROSS authors) — currently
    empty; provisioned per the project charter, not yet populated.
  - data/licensed/promogen2_derived/ (embeddings and results derived from
    running the CC-BY-NC-4.0-licensed PromoGen2 model) — see that
    directory's own LICENSE file (CC-BY-NC-4.0, non-commercial).
  - raw/ supplementary tables from Johns et al. 2018 (Springer Nature
    copyright) — NOT redistributed in this package; see data/core/CITATION.md
    for how to obtain them from the publisher.
